"citation_ids":["cite.long.record-257bm-c1"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-c1"],"id":"long.record-257bm-c1","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.67 (Compactness from exact finite sums)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.67, p. 63, label record:257bm-c1","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Suppose the cofinal exact-row condition in Definition 6.66 holds. Then $1/2\\in\\mathcal A$. For each $N$, choose an exact row $D_N$ at depth $n_N\\ge\\max\\{N,1\\}$. Proposition 6.98 gives\n$$\n\\left|X_{D_N}(2)-\\frac12\\right|\n       \\le\\frac{n_N+1}{2^{n_N}}\\longrightarrow0.\n$$\nEvery $X_{D_N}(2)$ belongs to the closed set $\\mathcal A$, so its limit does too. No finite support represents $1/2$; the representing support is therefore infinite. The proof does not require the chosen rows to be nested. The unproved input is their existence at unbounded depths.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c1","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c1","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c1%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.HalfCarryReachability.finite_boolSupport_ne_half%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c1%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.HalfCarryReachability.finite_boolSupport_ne_half%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.HalfCarryReachability.finite_boolSupport_ne_half"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c1","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a